## 🌟 Overview

**Opspilot-AI** is an intelligent operations platform designed to simplify operational workflows, improve system visibility, identify potential issues, and support smarter decision-making through Artificial Intelligence.

The platform combines operational analytics, intelligent monitoring, automation capabilities, and AI-driven insights into a unified operations intelligence experience.

Opspilot-AI aims to transform complex operational activities into streamlined, intelligent, and actionable workflows.

